UID:86451806f1cce917ea58fcd9193fb0@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:2 Day Plein Air Painting Workshop Saturday and Sunday\, Septem
 ber 5 and 6 9am to 4pm Master Light & Color in Falmouth! Join this immersi
