 alances tranquil...\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.
 capecodchamber.org/event/sunset-sail-on-the-cutter-bloodhound/52244/
LOCATION:Provincetown\, MA\, 10W MacMillan Pier\, Provincetown\, MA\, 0265
