 seful resource for those interested in researching their family history. I
 n a one-day workshop\, Lisa teaches topics ranging from getting started an
 d organizing your research to finding the resources you need to answer you
 r research questions. This course is perfect for the beginning genealogist
  as well as for people getting back into their family history research. We
  will offer an advanced workshop later this year to provide in-depth guide
 lines on researching your Revolutionary War ancestors.\n\nSources: The Ber
