SUMMARY:K-Pop Dance Battle – A Dance Party for the Whole Family
DTSTART:20261004T130000
DTEND:20261004T150000
DTSTAMP:20260829T140301Z
UID:f53abc500213cb8cef36fdc4da4741@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:NO SITTER NECESSARY: K-POP DANCE PARTY – DANCE BATTLE IS COM
 ING TO THE CUT LIVE! You’ve been playing the soundtrack in the car line.
  Singing it at home. Dancing in the kitchen. Now take it to the dance floo
 r. After packed dance floors and viral moments for the K Pop Parties at Th
 e Cut Live\, No Sitter Necessary is coming back bigger\, louder and even m
 ore unhinged for our brand new Summer Pop Dance Battle edition. Parents vs
 . Kids battle it out on the dance floor in a full-on family party built fo
 r kids AND the grownups who still know every word to the throwbacks. Expec
 t epic dance battles. Massive line dance mashups. Hype MC callouts. Throwb
 ack karaoke moments for parents. And a packed dance floor where literally 
 anything can happen. We’re running it back with hits like: Whip Nae Nae.
  Cha Cha Slide. Cupid Shuffle. Crank That. Plus K Pop hits like Gnarly and
  Pinky Up\, What It Sounds Like. Disney 2000s throwbacks (think your favor
 ite High School Musical anthem). And the college dance floor jams parents 
 forgot they still knew every word to. This isn’t a sit-down kids show. C
 ut the rug is going to be an understatement for your family. Parents and k
 ids. Same dance floor. No sitting.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page
 : https://northofboston.org/event/k-pop-dance-battle-a-dance-party-for-the
 -whole-family/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/k-pop-dance-battle-a-dance-party-for-t
 he-whole-family/
