BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stacey Kent
DTSTART:20261009T193000
DTEND:20261009T210000
DTSTAMP:20260829T140301Z
UID:2255f7a0f976cfbd8d987f8c54a7ed@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Stacey Kent is one of the most elegant and expressive voices i
 n contemporary jazz\, celebrated worldwide for her intimate style\, emotio
 nal clarity\, and genre-spanning repertoire. An American jazz singer in th
 e mold of the greats\, Kent has earned a Grammy nomination\, sold over two
  million albums\, surpassed one billion streams\, and received numerous Go
 ld and Platinum certifications. Her global following is drawn to her delic
 ately nuanced interpretations and her rare ability to communicate deep fee
 ling with restraint and grace. “Stacey Kent…transforms songs into shor
 t stories that brim with passion\, romance\, and wonder. Lean into her mut
 ed declarations and Kent can bring the world to you.” — New Yorker Mag
 azine Kent’s repertoire moves effortlessly between jazz standards\, Fren
 ch chanson\, Brazilian bossa nova\, and original works written especially 
 for her. Many of these songs are composed by her husband and longtime musi
 cal partner\, saxophonist and producer Jim Tomlinson\, often in collaborat
 ion with Nobel Prize–winning author Kazuo Ishiguro. Her recordings also 
 include collaborations with Brazilian legends Marcos Valle\, Roberto Menes
 cal\, and Danilo Caymmi\, as well as the renowned Quatuor Ébène. With 14
  studio albums to her name\, highlights include the Grammy-nominated\, Pla
 tinum-selling Breakfast On The Morning Tram\, the orchestral I Know I Drea
 m\, and the award-winning duo album Songs From Other Places. Kent has perf
 ormed in nearly 60 countries\, gracing major concert halls\, festivals\, a
 nd jazz clubs with performances praised for their intimacy and sophisticat
 ion. In concert\, Stacey Kent creates a refined\, welcoming atmosphere—i
 nviting audiences into a world of subtle swing\, poetic storytelling\, and
  musical conversation. Her performances are timeless\, deeply personal\, a
 nd quietly unforgettable.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https:/
 /northofboston.org/event/stacey-kent/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/stacey-kent/
END:VEVENT
