BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Doug Varone and Dancers
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTSTAMP:20260829T140301Z
UID:7797565f23ccdf1f014318be6903da@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Jacob’s Pillow welcomes 11-time Bessie Award-winningDoug Var
 one and Dancers to present a program in the Doris Duke Theatre in celebrat
 ion of the renowned company’s 40th anniversary. Known for dances that ar
 e both kinetically thrilling and emotionally resonant\, Doug Varone and hi
 s collaborators’ work spans concert dance\, opera\, theater\, film\, and
  multidisciplinary performance. Varone is celebrated for making essential 
 connections and illuminating the complexity of the human spirit through mo
 vement.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/eve
 nts-old/doug-varone-and-dancers/
LOCATION:Jacob&#8217\;s Pillow\, 358 George Carter Road\, Becket\, MA\, 01
 223
