BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Food Workshop: Celebrate the Cranberry
DTSTART:20261114T100000
DTEND:20261114T123000
DTSTAMP:20260829T140301Z
UID:7345b7d369e7e4a435c914c77e50f7@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:With Thanksgiving on the horizon\, it’s time to celebrate th
 e cranberry. Hancock Shakers gathered cranberries in a bog near the North 
 Family and kept them for use all winter long. This year’s workshop will 
 focus on pear-cranberry jam and/ apple cranberry compote just in time for 
 you to plan your Thanksgiving menu. You’ll work in the Brick Dwelling Ki
 tchen. Suitable for ages 14 and up.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page
 : https://berkshires.org/events-old/food-workshop-celebrate-the-cranberry/
LOCATION:Hancock Shaker Village\, 1843 West Housatonic Street\, Pittsfield
 \, MA\, 01201
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/food-workshop-celebrate-the-cranberr
 y/
END:VEVENT
