 e Jesuit tradition\, the program invites students to develop their leaders
 hip through reflection\, discernment\, and collaboration while building me
 aningful relationships across campus. Student groups participating in the 
 August 30\, 2026 sessions include: Recognized Student Organization (RSO) l
 eaders\, Peer Educators\, Student Government Association (SGA)\, Montserra
 t Ambassador Group and Campus Activities Board (CAB). *Any student who alr
 eady attended the August 15-16 session does not need to attend the August 
 30 training date. --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=21
